1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,290
On the 8th of May 1980,

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:05,040
the world's health leaders declared that smallpox was gone.

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:09,305
Health workers travelled to every country where smallpox still

4
00:00:09,305 --> 00:00:12,902
lived, vaccinating everyone around each new case until there

5
00:00:12,902 --> 00:00:14,730
was nowhere left for it to go.

6
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:18,292
And because no one alive today needs a vaccine against

7
00:00:18,292 --> 00:00:20,920
smallpox, most of us have never seen it at all.

